>> title: Egg Cream
>> category: Drinks
>> tags: chocolate, seltzer, fountain, no-cook, cold
>> counters: Diner
>> aka: egg cream, chocolate egg cream, Brooklyn egg cream, U-bet egg cream, new york egg cream
>> servings: 1
>> time: 5 min
>> step.1: stir the syrup into the cold milk
>> step.2: pour the seltzer hard off the back of a spoon
>> step.3: stir the bottom inch only

Stir @chocolate syrup{2%Tbs}(30 mL) and @cold whole milk{1/2%cup}(120 mL) together in a tall glass.

Pour @cold seltzer{1%cup}(240 mL) into @&(~1)milk and syrup{} hard, off the back of a #long spoon{} held just above the surface, until a white head climbs to the rim.

Stir @&(~1)egg cream{} at the bottom inch only, twice, leaving the head alone.
